{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical team-building roguelike auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team, level them up, equip loot, and stack Traits to maximize your synergies. Explore various Zones, bolstered with spells, passives, Masteries and other means of supporting and refining your build. Fight through randomized maps, battles, bosses and other challenges to help your team <i>escape the <strong>Underboard</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/17ca962ff792ea8cd9c7efa984b36a0c.poster.avif?t=1760419880\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/17ca962ff792ea8cd9c7efa984b36a0c.webm?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/17ca962ff792ea8cd9c7efa984b36a0c.mp4?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters battle on their own based on positioning and aggression. Look out for enemy threats and position your team accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactically manage your team and mitigate the enemies based on dozens of stats, skills, resources and many other modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells to actively support your team in battles or provide them with passive bonuses. Upgrade your best spells or reserve Mana for more tactical flexibility.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/7ea19cd4d47937ad8a5b05ecf6f6f290.poster.avif?t=1760419880\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/7ea19cd4d47937ad8a5b05ecf6f6f290.webm?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/7ea19cd4d47937ad8a5b05ecf6f6f290.mp4?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft a team of characters, enhanced with random Traits. Matching Traits between characters grants further bonuses to your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters by killing monsters and gaining experience, then unlock their evolutions by killing bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and craft items that can be equipped to individual characters with stat bonuses, extra traits or unique effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless combinations of highly synergistic Characters, Stats, Skills, Traits, Items, and Spells. Can you assemble the perfect team?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.poster.avif?t=1760419880\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.webm?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.mp4?t=1760419880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through randomized maps shrouded in fog of war, full of monsters and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Pinnacle bosses at the end of your journey, and kill them to unlock harder Zones to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Zone has its own distinct theme with new enemies, bosses and other challenges to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Masteries as you play, allowing you to further specialize your teams for future runs!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2376610?t=1760419880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/3c591dd941aa2b0d2bccf5fcd60cfe4384d30a54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760419880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760419880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760419880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3442130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical team-building roguelike auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team, level them up, equip loot, and stack Traits to maximize your synergies. Explore various Zones, bolstered with spells, passives, Masteries and other means of supporting and refining your build. Fight through randomized maps, battles, bosses and other challenges to help your team <i>escape the <strong>Underboard</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/17ca962ff792ea8cd9c7efa984b36a0c.poster.avif?t=1760419880\